  <s:String x:Key="S_Edit_EspacementMinimalMs">Minimum spacing (ms)</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="S_Edit_CesBornesSontPartagees">These bounds are SHARED by every mailbox of the same tenant. Spacing matters as much as concurrency: without it, eight calls leave on the same millisecond and trigger throttling before reaching the limit.</s:String>
