  <s:String x:Key="S_Edit_FormatDeDateIgnore">Date format (ignored when the value is not a date)</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="S_Edit_ValeurParDefautSi">Default value when the result is empty</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="S_Edit_LongueurFixe0Libre">Fixed length (0 = free)</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="S_Edit_RemplirAGauche">Pad on the left</s:String>
  <s:String x:Key="S_Edit_PourLesGedQui">For ECMs reading positional formats. A value that is too long is truncated: overflowing would shift every following column.</s:String>
